window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-036-a4f74d04f467c0c0.json"]={sha256:"a4f74d04f467c0c0818c667c198213a648a0a0d324996b2b385a82bc955d3acd",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-3483988fac4024a6","url":"https://docs.ceph.com/en/latest/rados/operations/crush-map/","title":"CRUSH maps","titleEn":"CRUSH maps","publisher":"Ceph project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-036","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-036","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-037","referenceUrls":["https://docs.ceph.com/en/latest/rados/operations/erasure-code/"],"title":"Ceph EC：小更新的完整條帶重寫模型","titleEn":"Ceph EC: a full-stripe rewrite model for small updates","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付雙拓撲、故障注入結果與範圍表；模型僅移除圖節點，不實際停用設備；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver both topologies, graph fault-injection results and a scope table. The exercise removes nodes only from a local model and never powers down equipment or modifies a live storage cluster. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"帳本分 useful_write、old_data_read、encoded_write；每項附採用策略，避免將奇偶校驗容量直接當實際 read-modify-write 次數。","differenceEn":"Separate useful writes, old-data reads and encoded writes in the ledger. Attach the assumed strategy to every term so parity capacity is not mistaken for a measured read-modify-write operation count.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["給定故障事件集合，失去副本數為其電源祖先被事件覆蓋的副本基數；不是將每個中間節點重複計次；三個副本分三 rack；名義其中兩個依賴 PDU-A，變更只有一個依賴 A；此次僅使 A 失效；名義式 1+1+0 = 2 replicas unavailable；變更式 1+0+0 = 1 replicas unavailable。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","模型選擇 k=4、m=2，每 shard 1 MiB；小更新先讀四資料 shard 再寫六 shard，放大量為總模型 I/O 除有用更新量；名義只改 64 KiB，完整讀 4 MiB 寫 6 MiB；變更提供完整 4 MiB 新條帶，只寫 6 MiB；名義式 (4+6)*1024/64 = 160 modeled I/O amplification；變更式 6/4 = 1.5 modeled I/O amplification。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For a specified failure event, lost replicas are those whose power ancestry intersects the failed domain set. Count replicas once, not every failed intermediate component along their dependency paths. Place three replicas in three racks. Initially two depend on PDU-A; after rewiring the synthetic dependency map, only one does. The modeled event removes PDU-A alone. Nominal 1+1+0 = 2 replicas unavailable; changed 1+0+0 = 1 replicas unavailable. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Choose k=4, m=2 and 1 MiB shards. The specified small-update strategy reads four data shards and writes six shards; amplification divides modeled read-plus-write bytes by useful update bytes. Nominally update 64 KiB while reading 4 MiB and writing 6 MiB. In the changed case provide the full new 4 MiB stripe and write 6 MiB without reading old data. Nominal (4+6)*1024/64 = 160 modeled I/O amplification; changed 6/4 = 1.5 modeled I/O amplification. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-046","referenceUrls":["https://www.opencompute.org/projects/rack-and-power/"],"title":"OCP 電源模組：單失效後的降額容量","titleEn":"OCP power modules: derated capacity after one failure","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付雙拓撲、故障注入結果與範圍表；模型僅移除圖節點，不實際停用設備；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver both topologies, graph fault-injection results and a scope table. The exercise removes nodes only from a local model and never powers down equipment or modifies a live storage cluster. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"建立 module_id、rated、derated、domain、load_share 表；以 derated 欄計算，分開正常與單失效兩個狀態。","differenceEn":"Build module identity, rated output, derated output, upstream domain and load-share records. Use derated output for the calculation and keep normal and single-failure states separate.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["給定故障事件集合，失去副本數為其電源祖先被事件覆蓋的副本基數；不是將每個中間節點重複計次；三個副本分三 rack；名義其中兩個依賴 PDU-A，變更只有一個依賴 A；此次僅使 A 失效；名義式 1+1+0 = 2 replicas unavailable；變更式 1+0+0 = 1 replicas unavailable。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","單失效餘裕為 (模組數-1)*每模組可用容量-負載；正值只證明此容量模型，不包含切換瞬態與配電限制；三個模組各可用 3 kW；負載名義 8 kW、變更 5 kW；可用值已含本課所有降額；名義式 (3-1)*3-8 = -2 kW margin after one loss；變更式 (3-1)*3-5 = 1 kW margin after one loss。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For a specified failure event, lost replicas are those whose power ancestry intersects the failed domain set. Count replicas once, not every failed intermediate component along their dependency paths. Place three replicas in three racks. Initially two depend on PDU-A; after rewiring the synthetic dependency map, only one does. The modeled event removes PDU-A alone. Nominal 1+1+0 = 2 replicas unavailable; changed 1+0+0 = 1 replicas unavailable. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Single-failure margin equals (module count-1) times usable module capacity minus load. Positive margin proves this capacity condition only, excluding transfer transients, distribution limits and common failures. Use three modules with 3 kW usable output each. Load changes from 8 to 5 kW; the declared usable value already includes all derating in this fixture. Nominal (3-1)*3-8 = -2 kW margin after one loss; changed (3-1)*3-5 = 1 kW margin after one loss. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-e22172468bb6c93a","url":"https://docs.ceph.com/en/latest/rados/operations/erasure-code/","title":"Erasure code","titleEn":"Erasure code","publisher":"Ceph project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-95d717ba7201260a","url":"https://www.opencompute.org/projects/rack-and-power/","title":"Rack and Power","titleEn":"Rack and Power","publisher":"Open Compute Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
